# Toolchain output (titan incident: every slice generates these, but the .gitignore was owned by
# a LATE slice — so no early slice was allowed to ignore its own output, and an untracked-file
# sweep raced a dev server mid-write. Generic, framework-safe entries only; project-specific
# rules (data dirs, upload stores) belong to the slice that owns the file.)
dist/
build/
coverage/
.next/
.cache/
test-results/
playwright-report/
*.tsbuildinfo

